{"id":27653,"author":"HotAndCrunch","body":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"font-size: 14.7px;\"\u003eIGN:\u0026nbsp;\u003ci\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 14.7px;\"\u003eHotAndCrunch\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"font-size: 14.7px;\"\u003eDiscord:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 14.7px;\"\u003ePatrick#7261\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eTimezone:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eBST\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eCommentator or Analyst:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003emainly commentator but I like to do a bit of both.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eCan you be active in the media discord channel, and are there certain times/days you cannot be online: I go on holiday July 16th so I will not be active after then for a couple of weeks. Apart from that I will be able to stream lots.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eDo you have experience in the competitive community (Knowledge of strategies and maps), streaming, commentating or analyzing:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e Yes. I have been a part of the competitive community for a couple of years now, playing 3 Avicus tournaments. I know the strategies and maps a I aim to play in this tournament, and therefore will be practising them.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003eWhy do you want to be a part of the Streamer: team:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"\u003e Because it seems fun, I have commentated before with another person streaming and it seems very enjoyable. I also want to give back to the Community.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"font-size: 14.7px;\"\u003eIGN:\u0026nbsp;\u003ci\u003e\u003c/i\u